    "## 🌡️ 8. Temperature Unit Converter\n",
    "\n",
    "### Goal:\n",
    "    Build a small converter for a weather app.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Steps:\n",
    "\n",
    "    Show a menu: 1 = Celsius to Fahrenheit, 2 = Fahrenheit to Celsius.\n",
    "    \n",
    "    Ask for the choice and then the temperature.\n",
    "    \n",
    "    Choice 1 → F = C * 9/5 + 32.\n",
    "    \n",
